    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Joy in the Morning"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A psalm; a dedication song for the house. Of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will exalt you, Lord,",
          "because you have lifted me up",
          "and have not allowed my enemies",
          "to triumph over me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord my God,",
          "I cried to you for help, and you healed me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, you brought me up from Sheol;",
          "you spared me from among those",
          "going down to the Pit."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sing to the Lord, you his faithful ones,",
          "and praise his holy name."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For his anger lasts only a moment,",
          "but his favor, a lifetime.",
          "Weeping may stay overnight,",
          "but there is joy in the morning."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When I was secure, I said,",
          "“I will never be shaken.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, when you showed your favor,",
          "you made me stand like a strong mountain;",
          "when you hid your face, I was terrified."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, I called to you;",
          "I sought favor from my Lord:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“What gain is there in my death,",
          "if I go down to the Pit?",
          "Will the dust praise you?",
          "Will it proclaim your truth?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, listen and be gracious to me;",
          "Lord, be my helper.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You turned my lament into dancing;",
          "you removed my sackcloth",
          "and clothed me with gladness,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "so that I can sing to you and not be silent.",
          "Lord my God, I will praise you forever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
